\
### Part 3: Worst-Case Disaster Recovery\
\
If the Oracle instance is completely destroyed:\
\
1. Spin up a new VM (or use any other host).\
2. Clone the code: `git clone git@github.com:pagnreach/GH310.git .`\
3. Push your downloaded backup back up:\
```bash\
scp -i your-key.key ~/Backups/gh310/pms_live_LATEST.sqlite ubuntu@NEW_IP:/var/www/gh310-pms/database/database.sqlite\
\
```\
\
\
4. Set permissions to `www-data` and your system is 100% restored.\
\
